cmqmi01y50004n0ck2yqd0tm7	cmqmi01b40002n0ckwd3jvs3a	review_aylanto_1	Hamza Abbasi	5	Aylanto Clifton is simply unmatched. Their signature Moroccan Chicken was superb. Easiest table booking experience using Pabandi—no deposit required because of my high reliability score! Paid via my Solana wallet and earned 25 PAB tokens.	2026-06-18 15:13:59.377	positive	f	2026-06-20 15:14:02.333
