cmqmilip5000b11yv4m84ib5w	cmqmilgw7000411yvgnrixmvf	https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114899705600034032007/reviews	Dani Huppert	5	Adelle's is always delightful but last night we enjoyed their restaurant week menu which is not to be missed! Warm and comforting tomato soup, amazing risotto, and chocolate mousse for dessert. Great value for 3 courses with generous portion sizes.\n\nThe service is always lovely and the atmosphere is cozy and welcoming while still feeling hip and trendy. The owners are so kind and truly want you to enjoy your meal and experience. Looking forward to our next visit.	2026-01-17 20:23:55	\N	f	2026-06-20 15:30:43.818
