cmqmiv17v000p11yv7tv5n2no	cmqmiuz9t000g11yv8lmqplsu	https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110377964878599105937/reviews	Heather Haynes	5	Passing through town and stopped for some Chicago deep dish.  We started with bruschetta - a generous portion served with at least a dozen small crusty, garlic bread slices.  It was full of flavor as was the pizza!  I prefer more sauce but it was delicious nonetheless.  A hearty meal in an "old country Italian" setting mixed with firefighter memorabilia.  Super friendly service and decent prices.  Not a full bar (beer & wine only), but seemed like a pretty vast selection.  They also have an outdoor patio for those warmer days.  Would definitely return.	2025-11-18 14:33:28	\N	f	2026-06-20 15:38:07.724
