cmqmwinxc0005d94260xrtar2	cmqmvqr46000aa6oixvipltgh	https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105602487070586316378/reviews	Simon Lee	5	This place was better than I ever thought it would be. I was extremely nervous initially because of the nudity required in the bath house, but there were women of all shapes, sizes, ages, and colors so I felt extremely comfortable. The staff was very professional and Yunna did an amazing job with my body scrub. It was very relaxing and my skin is so soft. If you’re like me and had been thinking about going for a long time but are too nervous, GO!!! I had such a wonderful and relaxing time. I honestly wish I stayed longer. Great place to go if you have a long layover flight or need a place to stay overnight. Go to the H Mart across the street and go to the customer service desk to get a voucher for cheaper entry. I’ve seen a lot of people complaining about the prices, but I think they are fair considering the wide variety of rooms offered and with how thorough the services are. They really scrub EVERYWHERE when it comes to the body scrub so I think that alone justifies the price. You are required to be barefoot and must remove your shoes before entering the locker room, but the floor is sparkling clean and they are all heated so you don’t have to worry about getting cold. My favorite rooms were the oxygen room, base rock room, ice room, and hinoki wood room. Overall 10/10. Amazing experience and I will be returning regularly.	2026-04-25 16:48:01	\N	f	2026-06-20 22:00:25.249
